## Protected Routes

```typescript
// src/routes/dashboard/route.tsx  ← layout route for dashboard
import { createFileRoute, redirect } from "@tanstack/react-router";

import { useAuthStore } from "@/store/auth.store";

export const Route = createFileRoute("/dashboard")({
  beforeLoad: () => {
    const token = useAuthStore.getState().token;
    if (!token) {
      throw redirect({ to: "/auth/login" });
    }
  },
});
```

---

## Rules Summary

- ✅ File path = URL path — follow TanStack Router file conventions
- ✅ Use `Route.useLoaderData()` for loader data — never refetch in the component
- ✅ Use `Route.useParams()` for dynamic params
- ✅ Use `Route.useSearch()` for URL search params with Zod validation
- ✅ Use `useNavigate` and `Link` from `@tanstack/react-router`
- ✅ Use `beforeLoad` for route protection — never check auth inside the component
- ❌ Never use `window.location` for navigation
- ❌ Never use `useEffect` to redirect
